  "bodyHash": "2d4d10a8e0f9eb17",
  "content": "\n\n你好世界\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/OVV5lXk.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8ZhXRQ4.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Available%20for%20Minecraft-1.19%20%7C%201.16%20%7C%201.14%20%7C%201.12%20%7C%201.11%20%7C%201.1%20%7C%201.9-ecebe6?labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge\" width=\"524\" height=\"28\" />&emsp;<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Install%20on-Client%20Only-ecebe6?labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge\" width=\"210\" height=\"28\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-animations-collection/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=2020709689%3A7498\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3yrSsw7\" width=\"320\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzles-lib\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3jr9xQw\" width=\"215\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-animations-collection/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=2020709689%3A7499\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3nRXr4m\" width=\"325\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/30lZmFY\" width=\"208\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzles-lib\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3jr9xQw\" width=\"215\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forge-config-api-port-fabric\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3clkhvn\" width=\"299\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8ZhXRQ4.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong>📖 關於：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">《更優質動畫合集》旨在透過修改遊戲內模型來提升 Minecraft 的氛圍，提供流暢的動畫與細緻的特效。它力求為適合的遊戲環節注入更寫實的感覺，例如模擬物理效果以及讓原本靜止的模型部件動起來。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8ZhXRQ4.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong>📚 內容：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>搖曳的鬼方觸手</strong>將鬼方的觸手拆分為多個部分，並讓它們如電影中常見的章魚怪般自然擺動。這讓它們看起來更嚇人，但整體視覺效果也更佳。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>靈動的烏賊觸手</strong>為烏賊的游泳動作增添水母般的飄逸感，並讓其觸手在移動時更加流暢自然。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>活潑的小狗</strong>讓狼的尾巴變得更蓬鬆飄逸，站立和奔跑時會真實地搖擺。同時讓被馴服的狼改為趴臥而非坐著。舉起肉塊時，它們還會翻滾撒嬌。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>飄逸的豹貓尾巴</strong>取代了現行豹貓僵硬的尾巴，換上更優美的動畫尾巴。無論站立或奔跑，尾巴都會隨之流暢擺動。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>捲曲的貓尾巴</strong>將豹貓引以为傲的動態流暢尾巴也帶給了貓。不仅如此；牠們坐下時，尾巴還會自然地環繞身體捲曲！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>哼哼豬</strong>加入了一項極其細微的動畫，讓豬在叫喚時鼻子會輕微上下晃動。雖然幅度很小，但確實存在。為你的家畜增添一點生機。別忘了那對飄動的耳朵！對於這麼小的動物來說可是相當顯眼喔。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>搖晃的牛乳房</strong>讓奶牛行走時乳房會自然晃動。同時也為乳房增添了乳頭細節，若您對此類內容較為敏感，可在設定中關閉此功能。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>搖擺公雞</strong>讓雞在叫喚時喙部會開合。喙部也變得更加纖細，再也不怕把雞跟鴨子搞混了！當牠們昂首闊步時，頭部會前後擺動，肉垂會跟著晃動，翅膀也會輕輕拍打。完全還原真實模樣！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>搖擺的村民鼻子</strong>帶來一項細膩的改變：只要村民發出獨特的「嗯哼」聲，牠們的大鼻子就會跟著搖晃！雖是小細節，但誰看了不會會心一笑呢？</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>搖擺的鐵傀儡鼻子</strong>與上述效果相同，只是對象換成鐵傀儡！由於牠們不會發聲，因此改為在受傷時鼻子會搖晃。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>液態史萊姆</strong>帶來令人賞心悅目的視覺變化：史萊姆內部現在會像液體般流動。跳躍時會溅出更多水花。眼睛、嘴巴以及核心本身都會獨立運動。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>岩浆方块汉堡</strong>為岩浆立方體新增了自訂的死亡動畫，牠們倒下時身體會變成一堆熱氣騰騰、誘人的漢堡肉餅。不過很遺憾，你無法吃掉牠們，因為實在太燙了。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>蜘蛛膝蓋</strong>絕對是令人驚嘆的視覺升級。蜘蛛終於實現了長久以來的夢想，擁有了真正的膝蓋。洞穴蜘蛛同樣適用。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>搖擺苦力怕</strong>喚醒了大家對當年 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k2rDbRUDkds\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">爆紅的音樂影片</span></a>的回憶，出自那位獨一無二的 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCshoKvlZGZ20rVgazZp5vnQ\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">CaptainSparklez</span></a>。還記得那隻超萌的搖擺苦力怕嗎？現在它已經實裝到遊戲裡了。完整還原，百分百真實，就跟影片裡的一模一樣。這很可能是整個合集中最棒的自訂動畫。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>揮舞手臂的終界使者</strong>讓憤怒的終界使者追逐目標時瘋狂揮舞雙臂。非常符合牠們扭曲的性格：就像那種會狂亂揮舞手臂的充氣管子玩具人！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>動態雪人手臂</strong>讓雪人在投擲雪球時，手臂會跟著擺動。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>跪姿綿羊</strong>這個設計相當巧妙。它讓綿羊真的會彎下身子吃草。不再只是低頭，而是整副身軀都貼近地面，去品嚐那鮮嫩多汁的纖維。你有注意到牠們跪下時「膝蓋」也會彎曲嗎？</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>經典老馬</strong>讓馬匹恢復生動，就像舊版本那樣。做法是在不偏離原版模型風格的前提下，重新加入了嘴部與膝蓋的動畫。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>吐口水羊駝</strong>讓羊駝在吐口水時張開嘴巴。以前牠們到底是怎麼做到的啊？！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>人形生物膝蓋</strong>讓殭屍系以及豬布林系的怪物行走時膝蓋會自然彎曲。看起來非常流暢好看。你一定會喜歡的，相信我。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8ZhXRQ4.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong>📷 截圖與影片：</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/383/889/2021-07-29_11.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\" /></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/376/50/2021-06-30_14.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\" /></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>搖擺公雞</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>跪姿綿羊</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/383/756/2021-07-28_21.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\" /></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/382/106/2021-07-22_13.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\" /></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>哼哼豬</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>搖晃的牛乳房</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/383/201/2021-07-26_16.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\" /></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/383/202/2021-07-26_16.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\" /></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>經典老馬</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>吐口水羊駝</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/383/193/2021-07-26_16.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\" /></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/382/111/2021-07-22_12.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\" /></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>搖擺的村民鼻子</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>搖擺的鐵傀儡鼻子</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/382/110/2021-07-22_13.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\" /></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/382/109/2021-07-22_13.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\" /></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>捲曲的貓尾巴</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>飄逸的豹貓尾巴</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/383/196/2021-07-26_16.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\" /></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/382/107/2021-07-22_12.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\" /></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>活潑的小狗</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>動態雪人手臂</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/382/108/2021-07-22_13.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\" /></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/383/190/2021-07-26_16.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\" /></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>蜘蛛膝蓋</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>液態史萊姆</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/383/757/2021-07-26_16.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\" /></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/383/758/2021-07-28_09.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\" /></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>揮舞手臂的終界使者</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>搖擺苦力怕</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/374/725/2021-06-25_13.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\" /></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/383/200/2021-07-26_16.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\" /></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>靈動的烏賊觸手</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>人形生物膝蓋</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/374/728/2021-06-25_13.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\" /></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/383/192/2021-07-26_16.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\" /></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>搖曳的鬼方觸手</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>岩浆方块汉堡</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/aQKmdRYwvGk?wmode=transparent\" height=\"231\" width=\"410\"></iframe></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/S3oko18JERQ?wmode=transparent\" height=\"231\" width=\"410\"></iframe></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>預告片由 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCEq5O5WCb2tTngspsMsyrrQ\">Loook's</a> 製作</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>評測由 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC7SktcUK2OPYQwe123rJVbg\">JKapGaming</a> 提供</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/BS0OOQJ5jQw?wmode=transparent\" height=\"231\" width=\"410\"></iframe></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/3I7i7oENjFI?wmode=transparent\" height=\"231\" width=\"410\"></iframe></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>評測由 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCyZA5Ysa33gA89sCdWJQojQ\">CavemanFilms</a> 提供</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>評測由 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCKlhpmbHGxBE6uw9B_uLeqQ\">Sky Does Everything</a> 提供</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/JGk4mXX6QQc?wmode=transparent\" height=\"231\" width=\"410\"></iframe></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/qkFSPBTdqXA?wmode=transparent\" height=\"231\" width=\"410\"></iframe></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>評測由 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCH-_hzb2ILSCo9ftVSnrCIQ\">YOGSCAST Lewis &amp; Simon</a> 提供</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>評測由 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCshoKvlZGZ20rVgazZp5vnQ\">CaptainSparklez</a> 提供</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/SEqjHrJlYy4?wmode=transparent\" height=\"231\" width=\"410\"></iframe></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/4DYa_7KAdd8?wmode=transparent\" height=\"231\" width=\"410\"></iframe></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>評測由 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCS5Oz6CHmeoF7vSad0qqXfw\">DanTDM</a> 提供</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>評測由 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCqg2eLFNUu3QN3dttNeOWkw\">iHasCupquake</a> 提供</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8ZhXRQ4.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong>💡 常見問題：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>問：如何設定這個模組？</strong><br /><strong>答：</strong>安裝我的 <span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>《Forge 設定選單》</strong></span></a> 模組，即可直接在遊戲內進行設定！</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>問：是否支援自訂資源包？</strong><br /><strong>答：</strong>當然！《更優質動畫合集》中的所有內容皆由原版資源構成，未使用任何額外紋理。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8ZhXRQ4.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong>🏆 致謝：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">《更優質動畫合集》的開發過程獲得以下人士協助與啟發：</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://www.minecraftforum.net/members/KodaichiZero\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>KodaichiZero</strong></span></a> 功勞最大，多年前為 Minecraft 1.2.5 版創作原始 <span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://www.minecraftforum.net/forums/mapping-and-modding-java-edition/minecraft-mods/1284100-1-2-5-the-better-animations-collection\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">《更優質動畫合集》</span></a> 時，製作了這些超讚的模型與動畫。若需查看繼續開發此專案的書面許可，可<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://i.imgur.com/D7CiEnf.png\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">點擊這裡</span></a>。</span></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/tr9zw\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>Tr9zw</strong></span></a> 啟發了物品檢視動畫的部分設計，源自其 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/not-enough-animations\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">《不夠用的動畫》</span></a> 模組</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/almightytallestred\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>Almightytallestred</strong></span></a> 啟發了進食動畫的部分設計，源自其 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/player-eating-animation\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">《玩家進食動畫》</span></a> 模組</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/freshlx_official\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>FreshLX</strong></span></a> 啟發了飄動的豬耳朵設計，源自其 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fresh-animations\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">《Fresh Animations</span></a> 資源包</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://mcpedl.com/user/trayblock/\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>TrayBlock</strong></span></a> 啟發了纖細的雞喙設計，源自其 <a href=\"https://mcpedl.com/improved-vanilla-mobs\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">《改進原版生物》</span></a> 擴充套件</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8ZhXRQ4.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/lunapixelstudios/projects\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=CurseForge&amp;message=LunaPixelStudios&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"282\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://twitter.com/LunaPixelStudio\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/LunaPixelStudio?label=Twitter&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=twitter&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"149\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/8ZmhaPPbjE\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?label=Discord&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"220\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1MOyd2u.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"300\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_/projects\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Fuzs_&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"97\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Fuzss&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"97\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC2l26SuCmCNSCPefpfbCX7Q\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Fuzs&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"89\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://twitter.com/Fusseel\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=@Fusseel&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=twitter&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"124\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/user/Fusseel\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=u/Fusseel&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=reddit&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"Reddit\" width=\"130\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Fuzs%200212&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"127\" height=\"28\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8ZhXRQ4.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<table style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/kiHP8s9.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-magic\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Mlxi8cy.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/trading-post\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/UzgNFIB.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pick-up-notifier\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DCwxKZU.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/console-experience\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/aXWOS7B.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stylish-effects\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fmWwWkZ.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/visual-workbench\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DTzDrbm.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/diagonal-fences\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mU9OlhP.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/golden-age-combat\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sHiR309.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/air-hop\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MinxlVJ.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8ZhXRQ4.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>",
